OL,3,GNEWSANoise complaint sees rescue
OL,4,Acockerel returned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman said she has returned her
OL,7,Frescue cockerel to an animal charity
OL,8,Fafter she was issued an anti-social
OL,9,Fbehaviour notice and threatened with a
OL,10,F#1,500 fine following complaints over
OL,11,Fhis early morning crowing.
OL,13,FLaura-Jane Wain, from Upper Halling,
OL,14,FKent, took in Bruce Almighty in 2025
OL,15,Fand said she had not received a
OL,16,Fcomplaint until July, when the council
OL,17,Ffirst warned her to take steps to
OL,18,Fminimise the noise.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
