OL,3,GNEWSANoise complaint sees rescue
OL,4,Acockerel returned
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's not a constant sound, it was only
OL,7,Fevery so often, and I loved it," she
OL,8,Fsaid. "I thought it was a gentle
OL,9,Fcrowing."
OL,11,FMedway Council said it had a "statutory
OL,12,Fresponsibility to investigate
OL,13,Fcomplaints that may be considered
OL,14,Fexcessive, regular or constant - and
OL,15,Fthat unreasonably interfere with the
OL,16,Fwellbeing, comfort or enjoyment of a
OL,17,Fresident's property".
